  <name>QCalc</name>
  <name xml:lang="ko">큐칼크</name>
  <summary>Five calculators in one — currency, units, programmer, formula</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="ko">계산기 5종 통합 — 환율, 단위, 진법, 수식</summary>

  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>MIT</project_license>

  <developer id="io.github.from104">
    <name>Seo Kihyun</name>
    <name xml:lang="ko">서기현</name>
  </developer>

  <description>
    <p>
      QCalc packs 5 specialized calculators and 10 languages into one clean,
      keyboard-friendly app. Built with Vue 3, Quasar, and Electron, it covers
      everyday arithmetic, unit conversion, currency exchange, programmer math,
      and formula evaluation — all one tab away.
    </p>
    <p>5 Calculator Modes:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Standard — arithmetic, percentages, trig, powers, roots, factorial</li>
      <li>Unit Converter — 15+ categories (length, area, volume, weight, and more)</li>
      <li>Currency Converter — live exchange rates (requires internet)</li>
      <li>Radix Converter — binary/octal/decimal/hex with bitwise operations</li>
      <li>Formula — type math expressions directly using mathjs syntax</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Productivity and Accessibility:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>64-digit precision powered by mathjs BigNumber</li>
      <li>Calculation history with notes and CSV export/import</li>
      <li>10 languages — Korean, English, Japanese, Chinese, Hindi, German, Spanish, French, Portuguese, Russian</li>
      <li>ARIA labels, screen reader announcements, keyboard focus indicators, reduced motion support</li>
      <li>Multiple color themes, dark mode, and keyboard-first design</li>
      <li>Settings and history export/import for consistent environments</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

